{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f7de1cdc28c900275837ba0e918ab9315a19cd37bb4f87118dd948c3cdb0c977", "ja": "（以前、千鶴さん達が挿入歌を担当した\n『ドラマMILLION』のSpecial放送が決定した）", "zh": "（之前，千鹤小姐她们负责插曲的《Drama MILLION》决定进行特别播出）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1001_p", "source_sha256": "565efe2de81adc18fc1521c44cc907b780bdc5f252b8b91552d75332a5d101d6", "ja": "（そのうちの一作品に、765プロのアイドル達が\n出演者として抜擢された。これは大きな仕事だ！）", "zh": "（其中一部作品选中了765事务所的偶像们担任出演者。这可是份大工作！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0f234533ca90576377a295c9ce66073a479cf04d5a06867ce43f1fd23933cba5", "ja": "（しかも……）", "zh": "（而且……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6a712de4e3c726dad6911e57ce7f39f6a66926a772b82c2900a69bbbf874ee8a", "ja": "お疲れさまです！\nあっ、千鶴さん。ちょうど良かった！", "zh": "辛苦了！\n啊，千鹤小姐。来得正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "75bba2e2588d7e2af2350dd1516a3ca530ccb3bb80c899e69a838082dcc5daea", "ja": "あら、{$P$}。\nどうかしたんですの？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}。发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "99738abdb75742333660bfe7541e6c845cc1b4ca109f0e6b475b4fad5b1934f8", "ja": "お疲れさまです。", "zh": "辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "99738abdb75742333660bfe7541e6c845cc1b4ca109f0e6b475b4fad5b1934f8", "ja": "お疲れさまです。", "zh": "辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1007_p", "source_sha256": "34920120bfd0d3bd34f496a724f9e281240bff610bd6d11342abb39593a293b4", "ja": "紬、静香も一緒だったんだな。もしかして、\n今度のドラマの話をしていたとか？", "zh": "紬，原来静香也和你在一起啊。难道你们刚才在聊即将出演的电视剧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "d882ecb8a958e216a48b6c5a22e60123159b21d6a4b6ed4ae463381b0363cf72", "ja": "ふふっ、ご明察ですわ！　原作を読んだので、\n楽しみですわねと話していたところですのよ。", "zh": "呵呵，您猜得真准！我们读过原作，刚才正说着真让人期待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4e6ee45dfa0e64f1470297b5d18ab42560bbcb42bf76b835fcd21e3c54c1e019", "ja": "とても、心に残るお話でした。ところで、\n誰がどの役をやるかは、もう決まったのですか？", "zh": "这是一个令人久久难忘的故事。对了，谁出演哪个角色，已经决定了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a20cdb5042301b4a3e51e72576301f32f3230ca347c991181555485ff27f6de7", "ja": "ああ。その話をしようと思ってたんだけど……\n莉緒とあずささんがまだだな。", "zh": "啊，我正打算说这件事……  \n莉绪和梓还没决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1011_se", "source_sha256": "87e635fd0d100f0fbbd5243bd40b01894e9976e8c04c32bfc008a2e2a25d0c8d", "ja": "バタバタバタ……バタン！", "zh": "啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "265bf03bf4c5b51afb0942a67b288db028576336512535a0eb9f43358290a36b", "ja": "お疲れさま～！　時間は……\nピッタリよ、あずさちゃん！　遅刻じゃないわ！", "zh": "辛苦啦～！时间……\n刚刚好哦，阿梓莎！没有迟到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "f601214a4e922968016bbc870db875c99e600a206007c771bde7d66e0e62fa0c", "ja": "ふぅ……間に合ってよかったわね、莉緒ちゃん。\nちょっと、ドキドキしちゃったわ。", "zh": "呼……赶上了真是太好了，莉绪。\n刚才稍微有点紧张呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1014_p", "source_sha256": "456ca766a7bf4a91079ae9f339505b931696f33fb410506a66726b8b977a0d78", "ja": "莉緒、あずささん、お疲れさまです。\nそれじゃ、早速ですけど始めますね。", "zh": "莉绪、梓小姐，辛苦了。那就马上开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4661cac076e68dfa09203ba431cf8f70dba1c3d1859bcdd4309a2778ee56b026", "ja": "今度のドラマですが、配役が決定しました。\n主演は、千鶴さんになります。", "zh": "这次的电视剧，演员阵容已经确定了。\n主演是千鹤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1016_038chz", "source_sha256": "5a18889afd86bb994fbd702d899f98a44fb10d2a68ad3ca782ccabb0590892c4", "ja": "えっ……わ、わたくしですか？\nまあ……！", "zh": "诶……我、我吗？\n哎呀……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "dc8df6434d06f7f2f28f273e73a7c27e4cf7bd515575cbfff59f060a18095049", "ja": "まぁ……おめでとう、千鶴ちゃん。", "zh": "哎呀……恭喜你，千鹤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "b8e80b80b5d04690e047a4ff84d17228dc9998cb6b8d7ce85fdb316c23ff10f9", "ja": "本当！　やったじゃない♪", "zh": "真的！太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "fa6df2ab5945616894782d5566b5ec731983bc46a3d1c1f1f2bed688457c56ba", "ja": "え、ええ。ありがとうございます。\nとても光栄なことですけど……。", "zh": "诶、嗯。谢谢您。\n这真是我的荣幸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1020_038chz", "source_sha256": "66b0ed9726ef89e11f5593d68fc5bc023d2fa6124a2235fc73d9195e24e85a0c", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\n本当に、わたくしでいいんですの？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n真的，由我来合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1021_p", "source_sha256": "34ce447b517e76cd45f836216510dd41ccb2f6aa8aed04b06794c93c0e65c710", "ja": "何か、不安な事でもありますか？", "zh": "是有什么让你感到不安的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "d8d7dc795ced647c03973dec2de4ad672e622c13a805718182c14c16f1bc634f", "ja": "ええ。原作は読みましたけど……\n作品のテーマは、『片思い』だったと思うんです。", "zh": "是的。我读过原作，不过……\n我记得作品的主题应该是“单相思”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "743cf833b391b0f7cfc0961fe43c1af9ead0e6c8937166af2ed600a8b9ad6849", "ja": "それならわたくしより、静香や紬のような、十代の\nアイドルのほうが、相応しいのではありませんか？", "zh": "既然如此，比起我来，像静香和紬这样的十几岁偶像，不是更合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "7a6c0f0d40c55ea29f3309dc6c8e06eb9be5d98902d68967acf17b95ca6a0e4f", "ja": "そうね……片思いって言うと、\nどうしても初々しい感じがするものね。", "zh": "是啊……说到单恋，总觉得会给人一种青涩的感觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1025_010azu", "source_sha256": "3dafa4dd0f6bc435d281b0a6fdf412ae61bb2157243e421ca681f1049b44d956", "ja": "私たちくらいの年齢になると、片思い、なんて\n言っていいのかしら……って思ってしまうのよね。", "zh": "到了我们这个年纪，真不知道还能不能说\"单相思\"这个词……会有这种感觉呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1026_p", "source_sha256": "f12ec494e9e2f528387877c375571d992efa5253dad37613c9b26947dbb52585", "ja": "恋に、年齢は関係ないと思うので……\nいくつになっても、片思いでいいと思いますよ。", "zh": "我认为恋爱和年龄无关……\n所以无论到了多少岁，都尽可以说是单相思哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1027_p", "source_sha256": "86189f3a9f34400ffc4b58016d452b7293eb1422d74a5113954025b6bf016cae", "ja": "それに、大人の女性の片思いっていうのも、\nいいと思うんですけど……。", "zh": "而且，我觉得成年女性的单恋也挺好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1028_046rio", "source_sha256": "5edbc23ee3dc2538e22528a24929704ec8462f51f9afc7175e64b8c0f000dc6b", "ja": "ええっ！？\nそ、そうなの、{$P$}くん！", "zh": "诶！？\n是、是这样吗，{$P$}君！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1029_p", "source_sha256": "21fe5a8b6fefeaa489cfe9524c735518c5eb1ca03a1a2bbe46a2ec94c5cb0cb5", "ja": "うん。十代の片思いとは、違った\nもどかしさみたいなものがあるんじゃないかと思う。", "zh": "嗯。和十几岁时的单相思相比，应该会有种不一样的焦急感吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1030_p", "source_sha256": "036601b5f4376e237f558543e92bffb0ea2c44c9553bf39e803762436b5164eb", "ja": "それにこのキャスティングは、監督の希望だそうです。\n「是非、二階堂千鶴さんに」と。", "zh": "而且听说这次的选角是导演的心愿。\n“无论如何，请让二阶堂千鹤小姐出演。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "5c8076177406301579950e664d7c52464f0e332a08e029829cb2cac4cb4b4b46", "ja": "監督の……。", "zh": "导演的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1032_p", "source_sha256": "83b606ae243d312a0baf00b1bb13830bdd420c70dc43dbc1b1d5d262b23410db", "ja": "はい。なのでこちらとしても、\nできるだけ意向に沿いたいと思っています。", "zh": "是的。所以我这边也想尽量按照您的意愿来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1033_038chz", "source_sha256": "5d0b8e1ea27df176823181e33815751e04bb027c9243ed62a535e9f80d1821b2", "ja": "……わかりましたわ。そこまで言ってくださるなら、\nお断りするほうがかえって失礼ですわね。", "zh": "……我明白了。既然您都说到这个份上了，\n要是拒绝反倒显得失礼了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1034_038chz", "source_sha256": "199b50877d303b95ed83a66e581f6160b46478d824c2ad60ccea03cabf564049", "ja": "わたくしなりのセレブな『片思い』……見事に\n演じきって差し上げますわよ！　おーっほっほっほ！", "zh": "属于我的名流风『单相思』……就由我来为你们\n完美地演绎一番吧！　呵——哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "b3a7587a6d2176f8085f69481688e844291421875088ae3bda7117b3a935ab63", "ja": "セレブな片思いって、どんな感じなのかわからないけど\n……がんばってください、千鶴さん！", "zh": "我虽然不知道名媛式的单相思是什么感觉，不过……请加油，千鹤姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_105_1036_p", "source_sha256": "62354acce618a13e978b2c45ae9d84d389dcc724be5ef60ad98c0c2f365b53be", "ja": "（千鶴さん、乗り気になってくれたみたいだな。\nこれはいいドラマになりそうだ！）", "zh": "（千鹤小姐好像已经干劲十足了。\n这一定会成为一部很棒的电视剧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
